   "reason": "Known only through Bradbury's quotation of its aim, the history of 'the \"totality of the working class\"' (1987, p. 23 n. 1, citing pp. 23–36 at 23). No in-print exchange about it was found; Workers and Canadian History (1995), where it may be reprinted, is not open."
