The packet applies in memory with 187 entries and 1,023 relationships: zero errors and the same seven baseline warnings. Saved source texts are available locally, so I can check quotations beyond the draft notes. The applied result also leaves Perry’s linked roster row saying “metadata and chapter titles only.”
